  "derivation": "quotientrule gradient(\u22125y,5x)/(x\u2212y)\u00b2, x\u2260y",
  "independent_checks": [],
  "worked_solution": "Differentiate with respect to each variable, holding the other fixed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf_x&=\\frac{3(x-y)-(3x+2y)}{(x-y)^2}=-\\frac{5y}{(x-y)^2},\\\\\nf_y&=\\frac{2(x-y)+(3x+2y)}{(x-y)^2}=\\frac{5x}{(x-y)^2}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, for $x\\ne y$,\n\n$$\n\\nabla f=-\\frac5{(x-y)^2}(yi-xj).\n$$",
